<title>SOUTH KOREA: Bank of Korea to absorb 1.6 trln won through repos.</title>
<headline>Bank of Korea to absorb 1.6 trln won through repos.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Korea said on Monday it had decided to absorb 1.6 trillion won from commercial banks through eight-day repurchase agreements (repos).  </p>
<p>&quot;We have decided to siphon off 1.6 trillion won through eight day repos because of an expected excess of 1.8-2.0 trillion won in the market today,&quot; a central bank official said.</p>
<p>The repos will be redeemed on June 3, he said.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
